# Licensed and private data never enter the repository. TradingView serves its bars for display only; Yahoo
# series and issuer files are for personal use; downloaded papers are copyrighted. data/README.md names each
# folder's source. The repository publishes derived statistics only (ledger.csv, register.csv, results/manifests).
data/*
!data/README.md

# Private working documents (planning notes, build prompts, audit drafts, the private identifier list).
PLAN.md
PROMPT.md
BACKLOG.md
identifiers_local.txt
docs/*_draft.md
docs/*_DRAFT.md
forward/*_draft.json

# Per-run raw outputs: someone could rebuild daily series from them. Aggregates only are published.
results/raw/

# Local cross-checks import private sibling folders outside this repository.
tests/*_local.py

# Python caches, build output, environments, local secrets
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
.venv/
.pytest_cache/
.env

# Private cross-checks that need the author's sibling kits
scripts/*_local.py
